WEBVTT

01:41.630 --> 01:46.000
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.680 --> 01:48.940
[Episode 8]

01:58.360 --> 01:59.610
Why?

02:01.000 --> 02:02.760
Why do you always make decisions on your own?

02:04.120 --> 02:05.230
You don't trust me,

02:05.510 --> 02:07.230
yet why do you take the blame for me?

02:08.979 --> 02:10.490
Just because you're my master,

02:11.000 --> 02:12.030
you think you can say nothing

02:12.030 --> 02:12.960
and die for me?

02:23.320 --> 02:24.950
Using your death to punish me,

02:27.240 --> 02:28.910
is this your way of being a master?

02:33.800 --> 02:34.630
Master.

02:47.520 --> 02:49.329
You can't just end it this way.

02:49.850 --> 02:51.530
I will never accept your kindness.

02:52.940 --> 02:54.620
Even if I have to tear down the sky,

02:54.840 --> 02:56.430
I'll bring you back to life.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.750
I'll pay

03:00.000 --> 03:01.190
my own debt.

03:02.280 --> 03:03.240
What I owe you,

03:04.240 --> 03:05.710
I'll definitely pay you back.

03:20.800 --> 03:21.690
Master.

03:30.070 --> 03:31.630
Mu Qingge!

04:24.240 --> 04:24.830
Yishui.

04:26.120 --> 04:26.950
Su Yishui.

04:30.680 --> 04:31.310
Su Yishui.

04:35.480 --> 04:36.040
Yishui.

04:36.950 --> 04:37.870
I can

04:38.360 --> 04:39.470
let bygones be bygones.

04:40.000 --> 04:40.950
Did Mu Qingge

04:41.390 --> 04:42.090
tell you

04:42.120 --> 04:42.950
the whereabouts of the Spirit Spring?

04:46.750 --> 04:48.390
We still have a chance to turn the tables.

04:49.680 --> 04:50.270
Yishui,

04:51.140 --> 04:52.780
you are still the Demon's child.

04:53.240 --> 04:54.040
As long as you're willing,

04:54.120 --> 04:54.800
we can

04:54.830 --> 04:55.720
find the Spirit Spring again

04:55.750 --> 04:56.720
and reclaim the universe.

04:57.230 --> 04:58.720
Leading the entire universe,

04:58.750 --> 04:59.920
isn't that what you want?

05:11.240 --> 05:12.310
Su Yishui!

05:56.950 --> 05:57.970
You, an immortal master of the mortal world,

05:58.000 --> 06:00.160
are becoming increasingly outrageous.

06:00.510 --> 06:01.870
You stole the Ice Lotus before

06:01.870 --> 06:03.040
and chased away the guardian cat.

06:03.160 --> 06:04.800
Today you broke into my cave.

06:05.020 --> 06:06.980
Do you no longer care for your mortal body?

06:07.390 --> 06:08.390
I, Su Yishui,

06:09.080 --> 06:10.130
beg you to grant me the Reincarnation Tree

06:10.160 --> 06:11.000
to save my master.

06:11.160 --> 06:13.120
The Reincarnation Tree is such a divine object.

06:13.430 --> 06:15.240
You're just an immortal master of the mortal world.

06:15.270 --> 06:16.510
You can't just simply ask for it.

06:16.830 --> 06:17.830
I beg for your mercy.

06:30.190 --> 06:31.550
The Reincarnation Tree

06:31.570 --> 06:33.240
is right behind the Thousand Light Beams.

06:33.270 --> 06:35.390
Let's see if you can risk your life to get it.

11:58.390 --> 11:59.000
Su Yishui.

12:00.790 --> 12:01.390
Su Yishui.

12:10.720 --> 12:11.360
Su Yishui.

12:11.980 --> 12:12.930
Even if you risked your life

12:12.960 --> 12:13.750
to get the Reincarnation Tree,

12:14.150 --> 12:14.840
it would not be enough

12:14.870 --> 12:15.720
to compensate for the kindness you owe Master.

12:25.210 --> 12:26.190
It has borne fruit.

12:46.870 --> 12:47.720
These two

12:48.360 --> 12:49.420
are Master and Mu Ranwu.

12:50.200 --> 12:51.240
But why did Mu Ranwu

12:51.630 --> 12:52.840
have to rush into the formation at the end

12:52.870 --> 12:53.510
and lose her life?

12:54.440 --> 12:55.670
She was insignificant,

12:56.840 --> 12:58.330
but under the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Curse,

12:58.920 --> 13:00.010
their souls were shattered

13:00.040 --> 13:00.960
and mixed together.

13:02.030 --> 13:03.270
They can only be reborn together now.

13:08.150 --> 13:09.630
When will Master be able to return?

13:12.670 --> 13:14.120
The Reincarnation Tree defies the heavens.

13:14.670 --> 13:16.520
It will take 18 years for her to return.

13:19.000 --> 13:19.960
You're so severely injured.

13:20.510 --> 13:22.150
You need to go into seclusion to preserve your life.

13:23.010 --> 13:23.760
During these 18 years,

13:23.790 --> 13:24.790
if anything happens,

13:25.360 --> 13:26.550
how will you protect her?

13:28.720 --> 13:29.670
I have my own ways.

13:36.240 --> 13:37.600
Why are you extracting your own soul?

13:55.910 --> 13:57.320
The Reincarnation Tree absorbs the Golden Core,

13:57.960 --> 13:59.120
using the soul as a guide.

13:59.480 --> 14:01.240
After this, I will seclude myself and lose all five senses.

14:01.960 --> 14:02.910
This part of my soul

14:04.150 --> 14:05.480
can accompany her.

14:17.510 --> 14:18.670
You've also placed a restriction on her appearance.

14:19.270 --> 14:20.250
After she is reborn,

14:20.910 --> 14:22.000
what everyone sees

14:22.510 --> 14:23.920
will no longer be Mu Qingge's appearance.

14:24.480 --> 14:25.220
This time,

14:25.940 --> 14:26.640
I absolutely won't

14:26.670 --> 14:27.960
let worldly affairs disturb her.

14:36.840 --> 14:37.630
Su Yishui,

14:38.440 --> 14:39.720
when you eliminated Mu Qingge,

14:40.000 --> 14:41.390
the barrier you raised

14:41.790 --> 14:42.510
was actually

14:42.540 --> 14:44.580
to collect her remaining soul.

14:46.400 --> 14:47.210
Why did you give up

14:47.240 --> 14:49.000
the Transcendence Realm that was within your grasp

14:49.390 --> 14:50.480
and use half a Golden Core

14:50.550 --> 14:51.790
to reincarnate Mu Qingge?

14:54.150 --> 14:54.790
To break the curse.

14:55.630 --> 14:56.960
Besides the Face-and-Heart Burning Curse,

14:57.510 --> 14:59.200
Mu Qingge also placed another curse.

14:59.720 --> 15:00.300
It was to

15:00.320 --> 15:01.650
tie the lifeline of Mount Wester's disciples

15:01.920 --> 15:02.870
to her own.

15:03.320 --> 15:04.120
If she dies tragically,

15:04.550 --> 15:05.320
the descendants of Mount Wester

15:05.320 --> 15:06.720
will suffer the same fate for generations.

15:09.320 --> 15:10.480
Your Mount Wester

15:10.510 --> 15:12.200
has only a few dozen people.

15:12.320 --> 15:14.080
How can she risk the lives of all people?

15:14.630 --> 15:15.550
After Mu Qingge's death,

15:15.570 --> 15:16.640
the Spirit Spring's whereabouts became unknown.

15:17.000 --> 15:18.240
Don't you want to find the Spirit Spring anymore?

15:22.280 --> 15:23.920
If you don't agree,

15:32.610 --> 15:33.640
then I will fight to the death

15:33.670 --> 15:34.700
against all of you.

15:40.480 --> 15:41.550
In 18 years,

15:41.750 --> 15:43.510
you will face the heavenly tribulation.

15:43.910 --> 15:45.080
If Mu Qingge reincarnates,

15:45.480 --> 15:46.790
she can break the curse on Mount Wester

15:47.070 --> 15:48.580
and help you withstand the tribulation.

15:49.720 --> 15:51.200
Do you want to risk death today

15:51.660 --> 15:53.570
or fight for survival in 18 years?

15:55.620 --> 15:56.370
Fine.

16:00.790 --> 16:02.360
Heaven values all life.

16:02.820 --> 16:03.790
I'll agree to your request.

16:04.270 --> 16:05.670
We'll leave this Reincarnation Tree.

16:05.690 --> 16:07.960
When the Reincarnation Tree bears fruit in 18 years,

16:07.990 --> 16:10.230
we will come back to personally oversee it.

16:10.480 --> 16:12.600
Even if Mu Qingge can reincarnate,

16:12.720 --> 16:14.910
we won't give her any chance to do evil.

16:43.200 --> 16:44.130
In 18 years,

16:45.390 --> 16:46.150
I'll come to pick you up.

16:51.790 --> 16:53.120
You're already at the end of your rope.

16:53.600 --> 16:54.510
Why don't you go into seclusion quickly?

16:55.720 --> 16:57.270
There's one more thing she entrusted me with.

16:59.220 --> 17:00.660
[Wangxiang Pass, Cave]

17:24.200 --> 17:26.200
I originally wanted to seal the Spirit Spring back in the netherworld,

17:26.710 --> 17:27.680
but I found out

17:28.280 --> 17:29.410
only the Demon's child at the stage of Transcendence

17:29.440 --> 17:30.160
could do it.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.310
I could only exhaust my Golden Core

17:32.640 --> 17:34.310
to temporarily seal this source of all demons in the mortal world.

17:35.590 --> 17:36.510
Su Yishui,

17:37.070 --> 17:37.720
if you still

17:37.750 --> 17:39.270
have a sense of gratitude to me,

17:40.110 --> 17:41.480
just promise me one thing.

17:42.160 --> 17:43.640
I've sealed the Spirit Spring at Wangxiang Pass.

17:44.350 --> 17:46.070
Please return it to the netherworld for me.

17:48.920 --> 17:49.640
Where's the Spirit Spring?

17:50.310 --> 17:51.960
Master said she sealed the Spirit Spring here.

17:52.480 --> 17:53.440
Why is it gone?

17:56.590 --> 17:57.280
Are you alright?

18:03.400 --> 18:04.000
I can't sense

18:04.030 --> 18:05.200
any trace of demonic energy.

18:06.550 --> 18:07.270
This indicates that the Spirit Spring

18:07.270 --> 18:08.480
is still well-sealed.

18:09.040 --> 18:10.000
For some unknown reason,

18:10.030 --> 18:11.240
it has been relocated.

18:13.240 --> 18:14.200
In your current state,

18:14.650 --> 18:15.280
you'd better

18:15.310 --> 18:16.440
go into seclusion and recuperate.

18:16.880 --> 18:18.350
Don't end up losing your life

18:18.510 --> 18:19.640
without finding the Spirit Spring.

18:20.030 --> 18:20.680
After 18 years,

18:20.680 --> 18:21.880
how will you protect Master?

18:27.670 --> 18:31.040
[Mount Wester]

18:43.400 --> 18:44.720
With this Reincarnation Tree,

18:45.020 --> 18:46.650
you still need to use half a Golden Core

18:46.680 --> 18:48.200
and a fraction of your soul as a guide

18:48.310 --> 18:50.200
to ensure her safe reincarnation.

18:50.350 --> 18:51.750
Do you know that?

18:51.920 --> 18:53.160
I'm willing to do whatever it takes.

18:53.960 --> 18:55.920
But are you willing to

18:56.070 --> 18:57.160
fail her final wish?

18:58.000 --> 19:00.040
Only the Demon's child at the stage of Transcendence

19:00.070 --> 19:02.030
can seal the Spirit Spring back into the netherworld.

19:02.440 --> 19:04.270
But with only nine-tenths of your spiritual sense remaining,

19:04.640 --> 19:07.030
you'll never be able to advance to the stage of Transcendence.

19:07.350 --> 19:09.110
Reviving her or fulfilling her wish,

19:09.200 --> 19:10.750
you can only choose one.

19:19.240 --> 19:21.070
I beg you to grant me a way to achieve both.

19:21.480 --> 19:23.070
A way to achieve both

19:23.120 --> 19:25.240
is nothing more than a temporary solution

19:25.400 --> 19:27.720
in exchange for your suffering.

19:29.030 --> 19:29.790
Please.

19:32.250 --> 19:33.930
My twelve-petaled Ice Lotus

19:33.960 --> 19:35.270
is the purest.

19:35.640 --> 19:37.880
If you use the Ice Lotus to complete the incomplete core,

19:38.030 --> 19:40.310
you should be able to regain the power of Transcendence.

19:40.720 --> 19:42.370
However, to incorporate the Ice Lotus into your technique,

19:42.400 --> 19:44.030
you must cultivate it without emotions.

19:44.350 --> 19:46.240
Otherwise, when your seven emotions are disturbed,

19:46.270 --> 19:47.960
the technique will backfire.

19:48.240 --> 19:49.520
If you experience extreme emotions,

19:49.550 --> 19:50.720
or give up completely to natural impulse,

19:50.880 --> 19:52.350
causing the Ice Lotus Technique to break,

19:52.510 --> 19:54.510
you'll suffer extreme pain.

19:54.880 --> 19:55.550
And then

19:55.830 --> 19:57.640
you'll lose the power of Transcendence.

19:57.830 --> 19:59.720
If you still want to fulfill her wish,

19:59.920 --> 20:01.240
you can only do so

20:01.270 --> 20:03.030
by sacrificing your life to seal the Spirit Spring.

20:07.310 --> 20:08.030
I won't go down

20:08.030 --> 20:08.920
such a desperate path.

20:09.400 --> 20:10.720
Hopefully not.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.070
Remember,

20:12.240 --> 20:12.830
in the future,

20:13.030 --> 20:15.030
Mu Qingge will be a brand new person,

20:15.120 --> 20:16.930
and you, Su Yishui,

20:16.960 --> 20:18.110
will become emotionless.

21:20.310 --> 21:21.550
When you return

21:22.270 --> 21:23.680
in 18 years,

21:24.550 --> 21:26.240
no one will be able to hurt you.

21:34.480 --> 21:36.400
Master put the Face-and-Heart Burning Curse on you

21:36.510 --> 21:38.010
to cover up your Silencing Curse.

21:38.550 --> 21:40.240
She hoped everything would end with her.

21:41.070 --> 21:42.750
If you hadn't sincerely repented

21:42.830 --> 21:44.680
and lived a life worse than death for 18 years,

21:45.110 --> 21:46.240
I certainly wouldn't have forgiven you.

21:46.690 --> 21:48.210
Don't expect any of the other disciples

21:48.270 --> 21:49.430
to treat you kindly.

21:49.960 --> 21:50.720
I don't need that.

21:52.060 --> 21:53.540
Master treated you so differently,

21:53.790 --> 21:54.830
and even died for you,

21:55.350 --> 21:56.690
yet you're still so stubborn.

21:56.920 --> 21:57.720
What's the difference?

21:58.550 --> 21:59.440
If this had happened

21:59.440 --> 22:00.440
to you back then,

22:00.550 --> 22:01.270
or to any other

22:01.270 --> 22:01.920
disciple,

22:01.920 --> 22:02.830
she would have done the same.

22:05.790 --> 22:07.030
It just happened to be me.

22:08.590 --> 22:10.110
She did it for her own path,

22:10.480 --> 22:11.830
for the greater good of the universe,

22:11.960 --> 22:12.750
for the peaceful and prosperous world

22:12.750 --> 22:13.960
she cherished in her eyes,

22:14.530 --> 22:15.800
and for the benevolent ruler

22:15.830 --> 22:17.030
she believed was more suitable for this land.

22:18.510 --> 22:19.920
But she still died because of me.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.480
I will never be indebted to her.

22:22.070 --> 22:22.510
You...

22:25.100 --> 22:28.210
[Carefree Pavilion]

22:35.840 --> 22:37.000
What's going on?

22:54.590 --> 22:55.720
It's the Soul-Devouring Lock.

22:57.590 --> 22:58.510
It's the evil magic weapon

22:58.510 --> 22:59.720
that is said to be able to absorb completely

23:00.200 --> 23:01.360
others' spiritual power

23:01.380 --> 23:02.380
until they perish.

23:03.070 --> 23:03.720
How did she

23:03.720 --> 23:04.790
get it inside her?

23:05.030 --> 23:05.590
Who did this?

23:06.440 --> 23:07.480
Who else could it be?

23:08.000 --> 23:08.590
Mu Ranwu.

23:09.590 --> 23:10.160
I thought

23:10.160 --> 23:11.030
she was forced by the Heavenly

23:11.030 --> 23:12.030
to do this.

23:13.270 --> 23:14.920
I didn't expect it was all planned.

23:15.640 --> 23:16.480
It seems she wanted to steal

23:16.510 --> 23:17.570
Mu Qingge's spiritual power.

23:17.640 --> 23:19.240
That's why she entered the formation and lost her life.

23:31.830 --> 23:33.440
Master was her only family.

23:34.310 --> 23:34.960
Moreover, at that time,

23:34.960 --> 23:35.650
Master was so good to her.

23:35.680 --> 23:37.010
How could she do this?

23:37.400 --> 23:38.480
We'll settle her score later.

23:38.630 --> 23:39.680
Let's remove the Soul-Devouring Lock first.

23:40.400 --> 23:40.830
Alright.

23:41.240 --> 23:41.720
I'll try.

23:50.680 --> 23:51.270
What's going on?

24:02.270 --> 24:03.070
I didn't expect that

24:03.830 --> 24:05.590
this Soul-Devouring Lock would merge with her heart

24:06.240 --> 24:07.640
after her reincarnation.

24:08.400 --> 24:09.720
Master's heart is unstable now.

24:10.310 --> 24:11.400
If we rashly remove the lock,

24:11.790 --> 24:12.960
I'm afraid she won't be able to withstand it.

24:14.310 --> 24:15.110
Mu Ranwu will be born

24:15.200 --> 24:16.310
in three months.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.590
Once she advances in the future,

24:19.030 --> 24:20.000
as one rises, the other falls,

24:20.550 --> 24:21.750
Master will surely die.

24:22.640 --> 24:23.830
Then I'll just kill her.

24:24.070 --> 24:24.640
No, you can't.

24:25.240 --> 24:26.270
The Soul-Devouring Lock has bound the two of them

24:26.350 --> 24:27.350
tightly together.

24:27.680 --> 24:28.400
If she dies,

24:28.920 --> 24:29.960
Master will die too.

24:32.400 --> 24:33.400
Now we can only help Master

24:33.400 --> 24:34.510
increase her spiritual power as quickly as possible.

24:34.920 --> 24:36.070
Stabilize her heart first.

24:36.550 --> 24:37.680
We'll figure out how to remove the lock later.

24:45.200 --> 24:46.830
Fortunately, Master is blessed by heaven.

24:47.510 --> 24:48.720
Although her Five Spirit Roots were taken,

24:49.000 --> 24:49.960
it was a blessing in disguise.

24:50.640 --> 24:52.000
It has been reborn as a Formless Spirit Root

24:52.160 --> 24:53.110
through the Reincarnation Tree.

24:55.440 --> 24:56.160
What are you going to do?

24:56.510 --> 24:58.110
If it weren't for you,

24:58.270 --> 24:59.110
how could Mu Ranwu possibly

24:59.110 --> 24:59.750
have the opportunity?

25:00.110 --> 25:01.200
Master can't stay here.

25:01.400 --> 25:02.510
I'm taking her back to my Tea Inscription Mountain.

25:02.680 --> 25:03.240
Don't you dare!

25:03.640 --> 25:04.830
I'm taking my Master away.

25:04.830 --> 25:05.790
What right do you have to stop me?

25:06.790 --> 25:07.480
If you keep Master here,

25:07.480 --> 25:08.200
what good will it do?

25:09.400 --> 25:09.790
When Master remembers all

25:09.830 --> 25:11.070
in the future,

25:11.640 --> 25:12.680
do you think she will forgive you

25:12.830 --> 25:13.640
for the harm and betrayal

25:13.960 --> 25:15.200
you have done to her?

25:15.830 --> 25:16.480
No matter what she does to you

25:16.480 --> 25:17.510
in the future,

25:17.920 --> 25:18.920
you'll have to

25:19.000 --> 25:19.960
bear the blood debt you owe alone.

25:20.270 --> 25:21.310
If she doesn't forgive me, so be it.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.830
I'll pay for her with my life.

25:26.000 --> 25:27.510
If she wants to kill me,

25:27.920 --> 25:28.920
I'll prepare the knife for her.

25:29.590 --> 25:30.750
If she never wants to see me again,

25:31.200 --> 25:32.400
I'll arrange everything for her

25:32.430 --> 25:33.270
and send her away.

25:34.000 --> 25:34.880
I swore that

25:35.680 --> 25:37.410
I would protect her in this life,

25:37.590 --> 25:39.070
and no one, including me,

25:39.920 --> 25:40.790
could hurt her.

25:42.750 --> 25:43.350
Moreover,

25:44.170 --> 25:45.040
I still have some questions

25:45.070 --> 25:45.960
that remain unanswered.

25:47.110 --> 25:48.510
Back then, before the Heavenly siege,

25:49.350 --> 25:50.490
she was already severely injured.

25:50.590 --> 25:51.480
Who hurt her?

25:53.400 --> 25:54.160
And at that time,

25:54.640 --> 25:55.960
if she wanted to carry the Spirit Spring with her,

25:56.250 --> 25:57.040
suppressing the Spirit Spring

25:57.070 --> 25:57.880
wasn't impossible.

25:58.320 --> 25:59.650
Why did she rush to seal it with the Golden Core

25:59.680 --> 26:00.550
and hide it in Wangxiang Pass?

26:01.240 --> 26:02.350
What exactly did she encounter?

26:02.750 --> 26:04.160
There must be something behind this.

26:04.270 --> 26:05.200
I must figure it out.

26:05.480 --> 26:06.680
I must remove this Soul-Devouring Lock.

26:32.070 --> 26:33.240
Work hard.

26:33.440 --> 26:34.920
Complete the task I entrusted to you.

26:35.750 --> 26:36.720
Then, you and I,

26:37.310 --> 26:38.510
for all lifetimes,

26:38.960 --> 26:40.070
shall never meet again.

26:40.240 --> 26:41.590
Every injustice has its perpetrator.

26:43.410 --> 26:45.130
Go look for the one who made you die

26:45.160 --> 26:46.070
beyond recognition.

26:46.310 --> 26:47.400
It's not my fault.

26:48.350 --> 26:49.500
You don't remember anything?

26:59.270 --> 27:00.650
To incorporate the Ice Lotus into your technique,

27:00.680 --> 27:02.400
you must cultivate it without emotions.

27:02.640 --> 27:04.350
Otherwise, when your seven emotions are disturbed,

27:04.370 --> 27:06.000
the technique will backfire.

27:06.110 --> 27:07.650
The Ice Lotus in your body

27:07.680 --> 27:09.960
will turn into ice needles piercing into the bloodstream,

27:10.070 --> 27:11.400
making you feel so painful

27:11.480 --> 27:12.880
that you would rather die.

27:13.000 --> 27:13.580
Don't be obsessive!

27:17.000 --> 27:17.750
Disillusion!

27:26.880 --> 27:27.480
What's wrong?

27:27.720 --> 27:29.350
I can't even criticize you?

27:30.110 --> 27:31.110
What's with your attitude?

27:31.590 --> 27:33.020
You were the one who treated Master badly,

27:33.240 --> 27:34.510
or would she have run away?

27:35.270 --> 27:37.160
You're confused and can't figure out your own feelings.

27:37.310 --> 27:38.480
Why are you torturing her?

27:39.480 --> 27:40.520
Immortal Master, you've misunderstood.

27:40.550 --> 27:41.750
Guardian has never done such things.

27:44.590 --> 27:45.350
Actually,

27:46.000 --> 27:47.510
Guardian is the one bearing everything.

27:53.880 --> 27:55.590
It doesn't hurt much anymore.

28:03.510 --> 28:04.200
Really?

28:04.550 --> 28:05.070
Guardian has always

28:05.070 --> 28:06.200
transferred her cultivation hardships

28:06.200 --> 28:07.480
through immortal techniques.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.550
He just never said anything.

28:14.750 --> 28:15.750
There's no need to say anything to him.

28:16.640 --> 28:17.160
I...

28:18.880 --> 28:19.400
Look.

28:19.880 --> 28:21.310
He's just

28:21.310 --> 28:22.200
too arrogant.

28:23.030 --> 28:24.160
I really don't know how you and Yu Chen

28:24.160 --> 28:24.750
have endured it

28:24.750 --> 28:25.680
all these years.

28:34.640 --> 28:35.310
You're awake.

28:38.350 --> 28:39.270
Go ahead and ask whatever you want.

28:41.110 --> 28:42.310
Why did I become like that

28:42.400 --> 28:43.270
after I left the mountain?

28:51.480 --> 28:53.110
What does it have to do with this branch?

28:53.550 --> 28:54.830
You were born prematurely,

28:55.160 --> 28:55.930
weak from birth.

28:56.510 --> 28:57.110
Even your heart,

28:57.110 --> 28:58.590
the source of life, was unstable.

28:59.020 --> 29:00.260
That's why your life was in danger.

29:02.000 --> 29:02.750
So

29:03.030 --> 29:04.400
your master brought back

29:04.400 --> 29:05.830
this branch from the Reincarnation Tree

29:06.070 --> 29:07.550
to connect with your heart,

29:07.880 --> 29:09.350
providing you with life-sustaining spiritual power.

29:09.750 --> 29:10.960
If you're too far from the branch,

29:11.030 --> 29:11.920
the spiritual power will be insufficient,

29:12.160 --> 29:13.680
and your life will be in danger.

29:14.310 --> 29:15.680
Keeping you on the mountain to practice

29:15.880 --> 29:17.480
was also to help stabilize your heart.

29:21.580 --> 29:22.580
Ranran, don't be afraid.

29:22.920 --> 29:24.350
I am your

29:26.550 --> 29:27.640
Fourteenth Senior.

29:30.440 --> 29:31.280
My name is

29:31.310 --> 29:31.920
Zeng Yi.

29:32.560 --> 29:33.410
With me here,

29:33.440 --> 29:34.310
on this mountain,

29:34.480 --> 29:35.750
no one can bully you.

29:38.480 --> 29:39.820
Fourteenth Senior.

29:51.160 --> 29:52.350
What are you looking at?

29:53.030 --> 29:54.710
There's no thunder here.

29:55.200 --> 29:55.890
I mean

29:56.310 --> 29:57.550
the weather today

29:57.830 --> 29:58.440
is nice.

30:10.350 --> 30:11.350
I see.

30:12.550 --> 30:14.200
Then why didn't you tell me earlier?

30:14.440 --> 30:15.480
How could I have known

30:15.680 --> 30:16.590
you would be so ridiculous

30:16.960 --> 30:18.070
to think I wanted to eat you?

30:19.080 --> 30:20.360
That's your problem.

30:21.030 --> 30:22.510
You're always looking so fierce,

30:23.070 --> 30:24.400
no wonder you scared Ranran away.

30:25.350 --> 30:26.660
The misunderstanding earlier

30:26.830 --> 30:27.720
was my fault.

30:28.480 --> 30:30.070
But I still don't understand.

30:30.640 --> 30:32.240
You and I met by chance.

30:32.750 --> 30:34.620
Why are you taking such good care of me?

30:38.510 --> 30:40.480
He owes it to someone else.

30:40.790 --> 30:42.160
He should do this.

30:42.750 --> 30:43.790
Owes it to someone else?

30:45.480 --> 30:46.890
Could it be my parents?

30:47.510 --> 30:48.110
No.

30:51.590 --> 30:52.440
Then who is it?

30:53.480 --> 30:55.550
Could it be Master's friend?

30:55.720 --> 30:56.830
-Yes.
-No.

31:07.440 --> 31:08.240
I understand.

31:08.920 --> 31:09.830
If that's the case,

31:10.110 --> 31:11.590
then thank you, Master,

31:11.590 --> 31:12.640
for taking care of me.

31:13.440 --> 31:14.160
You want to stay?

31:17.200 --> 31:19.000
Since I can only survive

31:19.030 --> 31:20.000
by staying and practicing on Mount Wester,

31:20.200 --> 31:20.960
then I'll practice.

31:21.790 --> 31:23.510
Although Master didn't make it clear today,

31:23.960 --> 31:25.200
he has saved me many times.

31:25.550 --> 31:26.790
I believe he won't harm me.

31:27.920 --> 31:29.110
When he's ready to tell me,

31:29.340 --> 31:30.420
it won't be too late.

31:42.640 --> 31:43.640
Carry it with you from now on

31:44.160 --> 31:45.200
to prevent any more accidents.

31:46.000 --> 31:47.160
Although the Reincarnation Tree is good,

31:47.550 --> 31:49.200
its spiritual power will eventually be depleted.

31:49.920 --> 31:50.920
If you want to stay alive,

31:51.240 --> 31:52.350
you still need to practice diligently.

31:53.270 --> 31:53.830
I understand.

31:55.270 --> 31:55.750
Oh, right.

31:56.790 --> 31:58.310
I have something to confess.

31:59.030 --> 32:00.070
When I came up the mountain before,

32:00.510 --> 32:02.070
I had my own plan.

32:03.030 --> 32:04.350
I wanted to save my friend.

32:04.830 --> 32:05.680
Your friend?

32:10.510 --> 32:11.790
It's a fragment of a divine soul.

32:12.200 --> 32:13.880
It's been away from its master for too long and is close to death.

32:14.410 --> 32:15.650
It's said that only Liang Wumeng

32:15.680 --> 32:17.240
can save it by using the Blood Chalcedony.

32:17.510 --> 32:18.270
That's why

32:19.030 --> 32:20.920
I took your Blood Chalcedony.

32:22.750 --> 32:23.610
Just for this thing,

32:23.630 --> 32:24.760
you're willing to risk your life?

32:25.030 --> 32:26.110
Do you value your life so little?

32:28.640 --> 32:29.630
What are you doing?

32:29.920 --> 32:30.790
Mind your attitude.

32:31.270 --> 32:32.400
Ranran has just recovered.

32:33.030 --> 32:34.310
Since I can remember,

32:34.590 --> 32:36.070
Ling Xiao has always protected me.

32:36.920 --> 32:38.510
It's my most important friend.

32:38.920 --> 32:40.400
I can't stand by and watch it die.

32:42.240 --> 32:43.510
So you came down the mountain

32:44.030 --> 32:45.550
to save this divine soul.

32:47.200 --> 32:48.830
What a bad fate!

32:50.050 --> 32:51.270
Once I find Liang Wumeng

32:51.350 --> 32:52.480
and save Ling Xiao,

32:52.750 --> 32:53.510
I promise to focus on

32:53.510 --> 32:54.750
cultivation on the mountain.

32:55.410 --> 32:57.200
As for your Blood Chalcedony,

32:58.000 --> 32:59.070
I'll find a new one

32:59.070 --> 32:59.920
to replace it for you.

33:00.270 --> 33:00.880
Is that okay?

33:08.830 --> 33:10.670
[Liang Wumeng's residence]

33:18.400 --> 33:19.450
This is

33:19.480 --> 33:20.510
Liang Wumeng's residence?

33:21.030 --> 33:21.680
That's right.

33:26.070 --> 33:26.750
Sorry.

33:27.200 --> 33:29.200
Master is currently in seclusion

33:29.220 --> 33:30.260
and cannot receive visitors.

33:30.740 --> 33:31.850
Then when will he

33:31.880 --> 33:32.750
come out of seclusion?

33:32.830 --> 33:34.280
Master is advancing in power

33:34.310 --> 33:35.590
at a critical moment.

33:35.790 --> 33:36.840
Two years, at most.

33:36.880 --> 33:37.880
One year, at least.

33:38.030 --> 33:39.510
It all depends.

33:39.920 --> 33:41.110
One or two years?

33:42.160 --> 33:43.200
Can it hold on

33:43.220 --> 33:44.200
until then?

33:44.450 --> 33:46.040
If there is more Blood Chalcedony

33:46.070 --> 33:47.960
to nourish this divine soul,

33:48.160 --> 33:50.310
it might last until Master comes out of seclusion.

33:50.790 --> 33:51.510
Blood Chalcedony

33:51.510 --> 33:53.030
is a rare spiritual treasure in the world.

33:53.200 --> 33:54.720
Finding one piece is already difficult.

33:54.960 --> 33:55.720
Where can I get

33:55.750 --> 33:56.960
more Blood Chalcedony?

33:57.270 --> 33:58.000
The key to Blood Chalcedony's ability

33:58.000 --> 33:59.550
to nourish divine souls

33:59.880 --> 34:01.400
is that it can simultaneously integrate

34:01.400 --> 34:02.480
the five spiritual energies.

34:02.680 --> 34:04.000
However,

34:04.330 --> 34:06.370
in the cultivation world, there's another

34:06.400 --> 34:07.960
extremely rare thing,

34:08.110 --> 34:09.190
namely Formless Spirit Root.

34:09.400 --> 34:11.110
It can encompass all five Spirit Roots,

34:11.380 --> 34:12.570
cultivating one to gain five.

34:13.000 --> 34:15.040
It's even better at nourishing divine souls than Blood Chalcedony.

34:16.630 --> 34:18.280
The Formless Spirit Root is that powerful?

34:18.300 --> 34:19.540
It can even nourish divine souls?

34:19.960 --> 34:20.920
However,

34:21.030 --> 34:22.800
Blood Chalcedony is hard to find,

34:23.230 --> 34:25.480
and the Formless Spirit Root is even rarer.

34:25.800 --> 34:26.960
I wish you good luck.

34:27.590 --> 34:28.230
Farewell.

34:32.920 --> 34:33.630
Master,

34:34.230 --> 34:35.190
Ling Xiao can be saved!

34:35.360 --> 34:36.960
[Auspicious and peaceful]

34:38.030 --> 34:39.840
It's all happening.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.920
It turns out that your Formless Spirit Root

34:41.940 --> 34:43.010
can also nourish divine souls.

34:53.679 --> 34:54.560
I've connected Ling Xiao

34:54.590 --> 34:56.000
to your Formless Spirit Root.

34:56.370 --> 34:57.330
From now on, you can use your Spirit Root

34:57.360 --> 34:58.190
to nourish the divine soul.

35:07.030 --> 35:07.630
In this way,

35:08.110 --> 35:09.630
even if we can't find the soul master right away,

35:09.800 --> 35:10.550
it won't be a big problem.

35:10.840 --> 35:12.190
If you want it to regain vitality,

35:12.590 --> 35:14.030
you need to improve your cultivation quickly.

35:15.840 --> 35:16.480
While waiting for Liang Wumeng

35:16.480 --> 35:17.760
to come out of seclusion,

35:18.230 --> 35:19.280
Ranran, you should start cultivating first.

35:19.760 --> 35:20.440
But remember,

35:20.640 --> 35:21.410
don't let others know about

35:21.440 --> 35:22.230
your Formless Spirit Root.

35:22.920 --> 35:24.000
I will definitely practice diligently,

35:24.360 --> 35:25.550
whether I'm baked by the scorching sun,

35:25.630 --> 35:26.440
soaked in ice water,

35:26.510 --> 35:27.710
or starving from fasting.

35:27.960 --> 35:29.030
I will take it all seriously.

35:29.480 --> 35:30.230
How can that be?

35:30.440 --> 35:31.190
How can we let you...

35:37.040 --> 35:37.970
As a master,

35:38.000 --> 35:38.960
how can you be so cruel?

35:39.150 --> 35:40.070
That's a pretty

35:40.280 --> 35:41.370
extreme way of training.

35:42.570 --> 35:43.250
Back then, Master

35:43.280 --> 35:44.480
taught me the same way, didn't she?

35:44.880 --> 35:45.840
Nonsense!

35:46.700 --> 35:48.470
Master never tortured you!

35:48.760 --> 35:50.280
It was because you were so unruly

35:50.480 --> 35:51.400
that Master had no choice

35:51.400 --> 35:52.320
but to use both soft and hard approaches.

35:53.560 --> 35:54.970
Do you dare say her teachings

35:55.000 --> 35:55.800
weren't thoughtful enough

35:55.960 --> 35:56.710
or effective enough?

35:57.200 --> 35:57.850
Look,

35:57.880 --> 35:59.360
being a master is not that easy.

35:59.590 --> 36:01.190
You need to pay attention to the methods.

36:01.320 --> 36:02.440
You're still far from it.

36:02.670 --> 36:03.400
Think it over carefully.

36:04.760 --> 36:05.630
It seems that

36:05.880 --> 36:07.480
the relationship between Master and Founder Mu

36:07.760 --> 36:09.230
is not as bad as

36:09.510 --> 36:10.630
it is said to be.

36:10.960 --> 36:11.760
So,

36:12.080 --> 36:13.330
your guidance for Ranran

36:13.360 --> 36:14.250
should follow

36:14.280 --> 36:15.280
our Mount Wester's principles:

36:15.630 --> 36:16.880
teach according to one's aptitude,

36:17.070 --> 36:18.070
and prioritize happiness.

36:19.760 --> 36:20.510
In this world,

36:20.840 --> 36:21.920
is there really such a thing as happy immortal cultivation?

36:22.150 --> 36:22.710
Of course.

36:23.280 --> 36:24.030
At Mount Wester,

36:24.110 --> 36:25.400
as long as you don't violate the sect rules,

36:25.920 --> 36:26.710
no one can control you.

36:28.840 --> 36:29.480
Really?

36:32.000 --> 36:33.190
As long as you can complete your tasks,

36:33.760 --> 36:34.590
everything else is up to you.

36:35.710 --> 36:36.480
Thank you, Master.

36:36.840 --> 36:37.800
I promise I won't be lazy.

36:38.550 --> 36:39.320
However,

36:39.600 --> 36:41.080
I only want to practice until I can protect myself

36:41.110 --> 36:42.190
and my friends.

36:42.550 --> 36:44.000
As for attaining ascension and becoming an immortal,

36:44.030 --> 36:45.230
or advancing to become a great cultivator,

36:45.510 --> 36:46.400
I'm not interested.

36:47.030 --> 36:47.840
I still prefer

36:47.840 --> 36:49.150
the lively mortal life.

36:49.800 --> 36:51.440
Is that okay?

36:55.030 --> 36:55.630
Great!

36:55.880 --> 36:57.070
I'll go make some delicious food right away.

36:57.230 --> 36:58.030
Master,

36:58.030 --> 36:59.000
you can try my cooking.

37:00.320 --> 37:01.800
Your body is in such a condition,

37:02.030 --> 37:03.030
and you're still thinking about food?

37:03.610 --> 37:04.610
Even if it's

37:04.630 --> 37:05.440
the last day of life,

37:05.480 --> 37:06.710
one should still eat and drink well.

37:07.030 --> 37:08.030
I, Xue Ranran,

37:08.150 --> 37:09.380
have always believed in

37:09.480 --> 37:10.290
being low-key in life

37:10.320 --> 37:11.070
but high-key in dining.

37:11.400 --> 37:12.230
Only in this way

37:12.230 --> 37:13.190
can I live up to my life.

37:13.650 --> 37:14.440
Master,

37:14.800 --> 37:15.510
what do you think?

37:16.710 --> 37:17.320
Do as you please.

37:18.150 --> 37:19.030
But I've already abstained from grains.

37:19.380 --> 37:20.290
These worldly things

37:20.320 --> 37:21.150
don't interest me.

37:21.440 --> 37:22.110
Don't count me in.

37:23.450 --> 37:24.120
He won't eat,

37:24.150 --> 37:25.280
but I didn't say I wouldn't.

37:26.230 --> 37:27.030
He is

37:27.550 --> 37:28.320
such a killjoy.

37:28.760 --> 37:29.480
Just ignore him.

37:30.000 --> 37:30.590
Senior,

37:31.190 --> 37:33.040
we met too late.

37:33.070 --> 37:33.840
No.

37:34.030 --> 37:34.480
It's not late.

37:34.670 --> 37:35.190
Not late at all.

37:35.550 --> 37:36.840
Then I'll go cooking.

37:45.800 --> 37:47.360
After Liang Wumeng comes out of seclusion,

37:47.800 --> 37:48.480
Ranran

37:48.480 --> 37:49.400
will remember everything.

37:51.920 --> 37:53.030
You might not be able

37:53.230 --> 37:54.190
to get your soul back.

37:55.590 --> 37:56.440
That's just a pretext

37:56.440 --> 37:57.510
to urge her to practice.

37:58.150 --> 37:59.550
I didn't expect her to give it back.

38:00.400 --> 38:02.070
But without this fragment of soul,

38:02.230 --> 38:03.550
you won't be able to repair your Golden Core.

38:04.070 --> 38:05.590
You'll be forever cut off from the Transcendence Realm,

38:06.760 --> 38:08.480
only able to maintain your power through the Ice Lotus Technique.

38:09.230 --> 38:10.150
Isn't that a pity?

38:24.190 --> 38:25.280
Su Yishui

38:25.480 --> 38:27.190
has successfully brought back Xue Ranran.

38:27.960 --> 38:29.510
Wei Jiu is still not satisfied

38:29.880 --> 38:32.330
and has sent disciples to search everywhere.

38:32.750 --> 38:33.510
It seems

38:33.810 --> 38:35.600
he won't give up easily.

38:36.630 --> 38:38.110
Just as you predicted,

38:38.490 --> 38:39.640
only Xue Ranran

38:39.670 --> 38:41.710
can stir up this storm.

38:42.920 --> 38:44.840
The day we're waiting for

38:45.360 --> 38:47.230
isn't far off.

38:47.780 --> 38:50.370
[Mount Wester]

38:53.550 --> 38:54.150
Ranran,

38:54.230 --> 38:55.110
I didn't expect that this time

38:55.130 --> 38:56.340
you'd run down the mountain and come back,

38:56.440 --> 38:57.000
and even make Master

38:57.020 --> 38:57.870
break our fast.

38:59.710 --> 39:01.360
You can still laugh about it?

39:02.630 --> 39:03.590
Listen.

39:04.150 --> 39:04.760
It doesn't matter

39:04.760 --> 39:05.920
if you give up halfway yourself,

39:06.190 --> 39:07.920
but don't ruin our reputation.

39:10.180 --> 39:11.310
You're right.

39:11.440 --> 39:12.440
It was my fault.

39:12.630 --> 39:13.480
I'll make some delicious food

39:13.510 --> 39:14.590
to apologize to everyone.

39:18.120 --> 39:19.080
But eating

39:19.110 --> 39:20.590
will amplify the desire for food,

39:21.440 --> 39:23.760
which is not good for self-cultivation.

39:25.530 --> 39:26.250
In this world,

39:26.280 --> 39:27.550
how can one be without desires?

39:28.070 --> 39:28.800
Even cultivating to attain ascension

39:28.800 --> 39:29.840
is a kind of desire.

39:30.550 --> 39:31.440
Senior.

39:32.230 --> 39:32.880
Don't be so formal.

39:33.470 --> 39:34.640
Rather than being pretentious

39:34.670 --> 39:35.480
and forcing growth,

39:35.810 --> 39:36.970
it's better to follow one's nature

39:37.000 --> 39:37.880
and guide accordingly.

39:38.150 --> 39:39.670
This is the true principle

39:39.670 --> 39:41.110
of our Wester Sect.

39:41.880 --> 39:43.150
Yes. You're right.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.360
Ranran.

39:54.890 --> 39:56.330
This is

39:56.360 --> 39:57.760
an invulnerable golden silk armor.

40:00.840 --> 40:02.190
Thank you for the gift, Senior Zeng.

40:03.590 --> 40:04.280
Thank you, Senior.

40:04.360 --> 40:05.250
-Thank you, Senior.
-Thank you, Senior.

40:05.280 --> 40:06.030
It's nothing.

40:06.150 --> 40:06.670
Don't mention it.

40:06.760 --> 40:07.360
Sit down.

40:07.590 --> 40:08.550
Sit. Sit down.

40:11.550 --> 40:12.510
Sit.

40:20.230 --> 40:20.960
Today,

40:21.070 --> 40:22.670
I finally get to meet Senior Zeng.

40:23.550 --> 40:24.510
Your hands

40:24.510 --> 40:26.840
are truly skillful.

40:27.480 --> 40:28.710
That's all in the past.

40:29.190 --> 40:31.000
Things are different now.

40:33.670 --> 40:35.190
Rumour has it that

40:35.210 --> 40:36.360
you hurt your hand

40:36.360 --> 40:37.070
because of Founder Mu.

40:37.590 --> 40:38.510
Is that true?

40:39.320 --> 40:40.810
Well, it's just a rumor.

40:40.840 --> 40:42.360
As rumors spread,

40:42.380 --> 40:43.380
they will go unheard,

40:43.550 --> 40:44.030
right?

40:49.320 --> 40:50.400
The demoness is dead.

40:50.670 --> 40:51.530
Wester Sect has been destroyed.

40:51.920 --> 40:53.110
What are you still stubbornly holding onto?

40:53.550 --> 40:55.000
Why not join our Qingcheng Sect instead?

40:55.360 --> 40:56.590
At least you'll have some protection.

40:58.150 --> 40:59.320
That sounds nice,

41:00.030 --> 41:01.230
but aren't you just trying to kidnap me

41:01.230 --> 41:02.230
to help you make spiritual weapons?

41:03.030 --> 41:04.490
I will never betray Wester Sect.

41:04.760 --> 41:05.760
I won't betray my master.

41:05.800 --> 41:06.190
Fine.

41:06.550 --> 41:07.360
Since you refuse to

41:07.360 --> 41:08.440
serve us with your hands,

41:08.710 --> 41:10.440
we won't let other Heavenly Sects benefit from them either.

41:13.880 --> 41:14.550
Later on,

41:14.720 --> 41:15.930
thankfully, your master

41:15.960 --> 41:17.110
arrived in time to save me.

41:18.840 --> 41:19.700
It's all in the past.

41:19.840 --> 41:20.960
Hurry. The food is getting cold.

41:20.960 --> 41:21.360
Eat quickly.

41:21.510 --> 41:22.510
Eat.

41:22.550 --> 41:23.000
Alright.

41:23.710 --> 41:25.030
Let's try Ranran's cooking.

41:26.400 --> 41:27.230
-Senior.
-Senior.

41:27.480 --> 41:28.630
Guardian specifically sent me down the mountain

41:28.630 --> 41:29.400
to buy some wine.

41:29.550 --> 41:30.400
He was afraid that you wouldn't have enough to drink,

41:30.480 --> 41:31.480
so he asked me to bring it to you.

41:32.320 --> 41:33.630
Yu Tong, you've come at the right time.

41:33.710 --> 41:34.480
Come on, sit down with us

41:34.590 --> 41:35.670
and try Ranran's cooking.

41:36.070 --> 41:36.590
Come on.

41:36.590 --> 41:37.510
Sit down. Let's eat together.

41:37.530 --> 41:38.690
Sit. Senior.

41:38.880 --> 41:39.800
Let's eat together.

41:41.480 --> 41:42.550
It smells so good.

41:43.190 --> 41:44.070
It's been too long

41:44.070 --> 41:45.400
since I smelled such delicious food here.

41:46.510 --> 41:47.550
Why don't we call Senior Yu Chen

41:47.550 --> 41:48.280
to join us?

41:48.630 --> 41:49.110
No need.

41:49.310 --> 41:51.040
My brother has always looked up to Guardian

41:51.070 --> 41:51.670
as a role model.

41:51.960 --> 41:52.710
Guardian abstains from food,

41:52.740 --> 41:53.900
so he won't eat either.

41:54.710 --> 41:55.320
Look.

41:56.000 --> 41:57.380
Poor Yu Chen.

41:57.550 --> 41:58.280
Of all people to imitate,

41:58.280 --> 41:59.320
he had to choose Su, that cold fish.

41:59.480 --> 42:00.230
It's a pity that

42:00.230 --> 42:01.510
he can't try Ranran's good cooking,

42:01.760 --> 42:02.440
right?

42:02.760 --> 42:03.400
Just leave them alone.

42:03.400 --> 42:04.120
Let's drink.

42:04.150 --> 42:04.550
Okay.

42:04.550 --> 42:05.840
Everyone, please try my cooking.

42:05.880 --> 42:06.670
Alright.

42:08.360 --> 42:09.280
Here! Xi'er.

42:14.440 --> 42:15.550
It's delicious.

42:27.030 --> 42:28.000
I thought

42:28.440 --> 42:29.340
when you came back to life,

42:29.360 --> 42:30.560
you would immediately reclaim everything

42:31.190 --> 42:32.670
and all grudges would be settled.

42:34.550 --> 42:35.360
I never expected

42:36.110 --> 42:38.000
we would have a chance to be together like this.

42:40.480 --> 42:42.230
When you know the truth,

42:43.730 --> 42:44.570
will you do

42:44.600 --> 42:45.760
as you said,

42:47.510 --> 42:48.960
for all lifetimes,

42:50.320 --> 42:51.320
you and I shall never meet again?

43:00.670 --> 43:02.070
I have another specialty dish.

43:02.200 --> 43:02.640
Wait for me.

43:02.670 --> 43:03.150
Just a moment.

43:04.280 --> 43:05.440
Enough.

43:11.000 --> 43:12.280
Master

43:13.580 --> 43:15.500
looks so lonely.
